{"explanation": "This unit responds to vehicle-dominated scenes such as trucks, buses, cabs and emergency vehicles. Within those classes, its clearest distinctive preference is for warm-tinted or neutral color over cool blue or green tints. It is also somewhat more active when the main subject is sharp rather than slightly blurry. Facing direction, subject size, cropping and tilt barely matter. The left-third position effect looks strong, but it rests on only 5 photos and is shared with a similar unit.", "rows": [27, 26, 29]}
```

